# Domains - nvim (actions/nvim/nvim_domains.kbd)
**spc + a** -- Actions
**spc + b** -- Bookmarks
**spc + d** -- Definitions
**spc + e** -- Explorer
**spc + g** -- Git
**spc + j** -- Jumps
**spc + k** -- Keymaps
**spc + l** -- Locations
**spc + q** -- Quickfix
**spc + r** -- References
**spc + s** -- Symbols
**spc + t** -- Terminal
**spc + y** -- History
**spc + ;** -- Commands
**spc + '** -- Registries
**spc + ,** -- Settings
**spc + .** -- Tags
**spc + /** -- Help
**spc + \** -- Compare
